0%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261012/202610122246287193.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261012/202610122246287193.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">本周一，国米股东大会通过线上会议形式正式批准了2025-26财年的财报。蓝黑军团过去这个财年总营收达到5.18亿欧元，净利润2270万欧元，连续两年实现盈利。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-12/6accef51b6b51native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">里昂官方：尤文租将奥蓬达腓骨骨折，至少伤缺至11月国际比赛日</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260729/202607290620595656.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260729/202607290620595656.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260729/202607290620595656.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">里昂官方通报了尤文租将奥蓬达的伤情，他将伤缺至11月份国际比赛日。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-12/6accf652e95cdnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">武磊：希望今年亚冠能比去年表现更好，主场能延续第一场的好势头</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.68" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261012/202610122307497619.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.68" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.68" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261012/202610122307497619.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261012/202610122307497619.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">亚冠精英联赛东亚区第2轮，上海海港将在主场迎战大田市民。武磊出席赛前新闻发布会，表示希望今年的亚冠赛场能比去年表现更好，希望主场能够延续第一场的好势头。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-12/6accf1d83d0b9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">无价之宝！梅西深情凝望告别战球衣：阿根廷全队签名+留言致敬</a></p><p></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">阿迪达斯官方发布了梅西告别战的纪录片，在纪录片中，梅西深情凝望着国家队告别战球衣，上面有阿根廷全队的签名和留言。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-12/6accf9e93610enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">即插即用！马卡：罗德里6000多万太值了，他已是核心及更衣室领袖</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260828/6a90a841075bc_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260828/6a90a841075bc_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260828/6a90a841075bc_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">《马卡报》表示，今夏新援罗